# REST

## 1. Admin
### 1.1 Register Admin
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/init
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": ""
}

### 1.2 Login Admin
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password Admin
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}


## 2. User 
### 2.1 Register User
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.2 Login User
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json
    
{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password User
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 2.4 Reset Password User
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "",  
    "password": "",
    "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.5 Profile User
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization:
Content-Type: application/json